,"shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"rGpDkBpwiuhgxOdBqol1Iw","review_id":"0kSMC_jq4W1Yw73ZQ6lxRg","date":"2013-08-18T18:27:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.945573627948761,"text_excerpt":"Le Bon Ton is one of my favorite places to see music in NOLA. I may be biased towards far-Uptown places since I live in the Black Pearl, but their lineup also helps their cause. I love seeing the Soul Rebels here since it's like their \"home\" bar (a la Rebirth with the Maple Leaf), and they put on a great show every time. As far as crowds go, this one tends to be pretty great: It's a small and intimate space, so you'll be bumping into friends and strangers alike; and people do tend to actually dance here rather than just stand around and take pictures, so it's a lot more fun. This is also a great place to just grab a drink or four and socialize, or watch whatever sport is on TV (I believe ..."},{"business_id":"rGpDkBpwiuhgxOdBqol1Iw","review_id":"TDwfTf0Gt2xY6fUXIdx4zQ","date":"2011-01-11T15:01:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9436013698577881,"text_excerpt":"I love the Soul Rebels and I really love Le Bon Temps. Its a, for me, typical NOLA cozy live music venue and you are sure to leave with a few new friends after a night out here. The bar isn't fussy just liquor and beer so don't come here ordering something off the wall, they do free oysters on fridays and dollar beers during Saints games. Everything is reasonably priced and I have never had a bad time here."},{"business_id":"rGpDkBpwiuhgxOdBqol1Iw","review_id":"j5OxPBsU7q_Do6_bVUmdaQ","date":"2016-02-12T02:17:53","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9412150382995605,"text_excerpt":"One of my favorite bars in town. There's a bar in the front where the main entrance is located and another bar in the back where bands play. Best nights are Thursday and Friday. Soul Rebels play every Thursday with a 15 dollar cover, and free oysters and music Friday nights. Front bar is pretty chill--you can sit at the bar or at a table and eat oysters or play some pool while you wait for the band to set up in the back. And if you aren't down for live music, you can hang at the front bar and barely even notice a band is playing in the back. The back is grungy and small, great vibe. I've never had a bad time at Le Bon Temps!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"rGpDkBpwiuhgxOdBqol1Iw","photo_id":"sLzKcQT4iBL3VSZAuLKEIA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/sLzKcQT4iBL3VSZAuLKEIA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9338167905807495},{"business_id":"rGpDkBpwiuhgxOdBqol1Iw","photo_id":"DehniK3zncHmS8vXwQrPLg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/DehniK3zncHmS8vXwQrPLg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8977495431900024},{"business_id":"rGpDkBpwiuhgxOdBqol1Iw","photo_id":"mNR7tCDAtj4gsfi0iujV6A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mNR7tCDAtj4gsfi0iujV6A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8819836974143982},{"business_id":"rGpDkBpwiuhgxOdBqol1Iw","photo_id":"SrA373_ivxsnIQPTxGzFog","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/SrA373_ivxsnIQPTxGzFog.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8359354734420776}]},"notebook_case":null}
